ution: Resolution): GameOver | undefined&lt;br&gt;- remember(move: TMove, before: SnapshotOf&amp;lt;TState&amp;gt;): void&lt;br&gt;- restore(memento: SnapshotOf&amp;lt;TState&amp;gt;): void&lt;br&gt;- started(): TState&lt;br&gt;- redoCapability(): IRedoable&lt;/div&gt;" role="class" typeId="GameEngine" kind="class" status="code" layer="1"><mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=fill;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#111827;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b45309;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="part-engine~band-1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="430" width="1185" height="558" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
